      "role": "user",
      "content": "the soil does feel pretty damp... i checked the bottom of the pot and there's a bit of standing water in the saucer. if its root rot, is it like a permanent thing or can i save it? also are there any specific signs i should look for to see if the roots are actually rotting?",
