      "content": "okay thanks. i'll try to repot it this weekend. one more thing, i feel like i've been following all the usual rules but it just keeps happening... like it's almost like something is actively working against me with this plant. is it possible there's something else in the soil or something i'm missing that makes it so hard to keep healthy?",
